diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 5cb94fc..717a241 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,15 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## [v0.1.35-test.1] - 2026-11-26
+
+> R48 hardening candidate. AirPlay identity verification now fails closed without a verified receiver key; no E2LB vehicle fix claimed.
+
+- Require an authenticated receiver identity from pair-setup M6 before first pair-verify; reject unpinned 403 fallback and missing/invalid static keys.
+- Do not mark pair-setup complete when M6 lacks a valid encrypted receiver identity.
+- Ignore stale video-success callbacks when clearing per-receiver automatic reconnect failures.
+- pair-verify 首次验证必须取得并校验 M6 接收端身份；缺失/无效公钥或无本地信任的 403 降级一律失败关闭。
+- M6 未返回有效加密身份时不再报告配对完成；旧连接迟到的视频回调不得清除新一轮熔断计数。
+
 Release notes are listed newest first. English is followed by Simplified Chinese.
 Test releases are experimental and do not establish real-vehicle compatibility.
 
